# Obsidian reference audit

Source: obsidian_1_6_android.jar (111 module classes identified from SourceFile + category constants; module names, descriptions and setting labels are plain strings in the class constant pools.)

The JAR ships a `LICENSE_obsidian` file containing the CC0 1.0 text. Nothing was copied: the bytecode is obfuscated and was not decompiled;
the features below were re-implemented in ZENIX from names, descriptions and setting labels only. Anti-cheat bypass options were intentionally left out.

## Transferred (re-implemented in ZENIX)

| Obsidian | ZENIX |
|---|---|
| AimAssist | AimAssist |
| AimBot | AimBot |
| AirStuck | AirStuck (client-side only) |
| AntiBot | AntiBot |
| Arrows | Arrows |
| Aura | Aura |
