| AutoTotem | AutoTotem (+crystal/fall triggers) |
| BlockESP | BlockESP |
| ChestStealer | ChestStealer (+Randomize) |
| ClickGui | ClickGUI |
| ClickPearl | ClickPearl |
| DeathCoord | DeathCoord |
| EcOpen | EcOpen |
| EntityESP | EntityESP |
| FastBreak | NoDelay (Block Break delay only) |
| FastExp | NoDelay (XP Bottle Use) |
| Flight | Flight |
| FullBright | FullBright (night-vision effect) |
| HelpMessage | HelpMessage |
