| LeaveTracker | LeaveTracker |
| NoJumpDelay | NoDelay (Jump) |
| NoPush | NoPush (players only) |
| NoVignette | NoVignette |
| Nuker | Nuker |
| Projectile | Trajectories (pearl path included) |
| Removals | Removals (fire, in-wall, clouds, shadows) |
| SeeInvisibles | AntiInvisible |
| Speed | Speed |
| Spider | Spider (plain climb mode) |
| Sprint | Sprint (+Keep In Water) |
| TargetESP | TargetESP (box mode) |
| Trails | Trails |
| Trajectories | Trajectories |
| TriggerBot | TriggerBot (+Smart Crits, Reset Sprint) |

